  "prefLabel": "Rko 201.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rko 201.02 Scope. In regard to complaints, pursuant to RSA 91-A:7,II and RSA 91-A:7-b, these rules address procedures for the pursuit of grievances involving an alleged violation of RSA 91-A in lieu of pursuit of such matters in the New Hampshire superior court.\n\nSource. #13921, eff 5-20-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rko100-200.html"
